{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/samplingdropreports"]}],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"samplingDropReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncStream"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers18SamplingDropReportV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SamplingDropReport","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SamplingDropReport"},{"kind":"text","text":"> { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The tracker’s worker samples each record after its enrichers and before the consent, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dropped record is never held, written to a store or delivered. Records a store recovered"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"aren’t sampled again."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Reports wait until they are read, merged: a drop joins the waiting report of the same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event, adding to its count and widening its timestamps. So the reports waiting unread are at","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"most one per event type, however many events are dropped. Copies of a tracker share one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sequence, which has one consumer and ends once the tracker has finished. A ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker’s is empty.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"hi